      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ELECTRIC KUNA (5) was strongly supported last start when a short priced favourite and duly saluted winning by 5 lengths at this track in a handy 21.91. Jumping from the pinch draw but likes the trip. The one to beat again. HANNAH'S PASSION (7) had the drop on the lead and went on to be beaten a neck into third (21.96) at this track in a Grade 5 over 381m. Overdue and gets her chance. ROSIE BROWNE (1) collided in the run last time but kept coming to hit the frame in a Grade 5 at this track (35.14). Must include in calculations. LIGHTNING DASH (2) is in form and worth thought again.",
